e","source_tag":"_t","target":"筛选器/数据/解析器文档"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d37b00185bb8b173e466179111a06d03a6b43cb7a0ec5fe81a33368484c9075d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fbea3183b03d5de229fb173b6417960f8edf8d2a2fbda3f5ac2f69fb73b0d82c","logical_entry_identity":"95d588bb6261bc7d66f791c154d7a8fca12a1277f3fa29df00da2d095876a675","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A belligerent minotaur with a destructive magical arsenal, and armed with a hammer.","source_tag":"_t","target":"好战的米诺陶，装备有一柄巨锤且拥有强力的魔法。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"55218e980d8e5e879ba4bad71919159bd0e1c06797a6de1a8940ff4d54912dcf","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fbecbda4007b2b60169e9d01a53b19652a2186e4a4e9a7cb763ff1ca0ee1d1c7","logical_entry_identity":"b6851d0a36f1bcab43d337cc9ea9b51fd36df4405d2e037f942a855494474f60","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Enter the caverns of Ardhungol and look for Sun Paladin Rashim.","source_tag":"_t","target":"进入阿尔德胡格山洞寻找太阳骑士拉希姆。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2ef31db51b904a0e5d8cab609267a104faa6047717a9f21588eb1fe73e4492fe","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fbf08d72d7bd8dea59cd66e17997b7be89b152cbd93352f8749a2a8405d4a068","logical_entry_identity":"f4e783569d0a117c6cc294ff419ac54b46da267fd9b0494cd3ef1de6a26e7dba","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The target's mental faculties have been severely impaired, making it act randomly each turn (%d%% chance) and reducing its cunning by %d.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标的精神判断力严重受损，每回合 (%d%% 概率) 随机动作并降低灵巧 %d。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"36c8d02261b4e43b099ad3b7834a91865cc1d88935715b6191b0d791494b570a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fbf4ab02c259e87a5bf18609baeb41a03208156cbbc6e6515e02ed2b0c4dfcbf","logical_entry_identity":"e5d58cc82e2df8b2a0b98ae2f4fb2b4a284f005afe19eb605e30234390e71619","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Reach through the collective psionic gestalt of the yeeks, the Way, to call for immediate help.\n\t\tSummons up to 3 yeek mindslayers to your side for 6 turns.\n\t\tAll their primary stats will be set to %d (based on your Willpower and Talent Level).\n\t\tYour increased damage, damage penetration, and many other stats will be inherited.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"通过夺心魔的集体灵能格式塔——维网——寻求紧急援助。\n\t\t在你身边召唤最多 3 名夺心魔心灵杀手，持续 6 回合。\n\t\t他们的所有主要属性将设为 %d（数值随你的意志和技能等级提高）。\n\t\t他们会继承你的伤害加成、伤害穿透及许多其他属性。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2f4ab441998bb0ed10501a53b18e46e7fb94863b32b1d6de7707ca87fb17275f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fbf9e0dabef5571dea6d5f16441bc29ebcd450a0f5e44ada09a21f0c8bfc3fb4","logical_entry_identity":"ba370368668d8b067daf757b69d39bdd7a8ebf819e10d258a76640d538aa8647","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"To arms!","source_tag":"_t","target":"武装起来！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"860330e2039c2a8e5bbf40cb20fd9f5b02af9a344ef46fb7fe577d302cc0ea8f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fbfb390df838de0fa4b815964d07b9d468b638ab94a9109dcd1c9bcf47b7a1cd","logical_entry_identity":"944707d4bc78d59e124886cde77bcf4f94054e4c6dcb5c23c4008913b6317f6c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"stat cun","source_tag":"entity name","target":"提升灵巧属性值"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b0f97bed9746c717a7d9cccfa3b57fca11f8ebddc8eb5b27d6ad7b88576a051e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fbfe9a977d2df26234fb0af6298d9b4866b42d94e52a3b3d209d44df6e14fb6e","logical_entry_identity":"093dd6ee03231a5ac0c31ce216e447cbd6a3a519b3dfed30ef839e2dd8a29c8a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You fire an arrow that cuts right through anything, piercing multiple targets if possible with nigh infinite armor penetration, doing %d%% damage.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你射出一支能穿透任何东西的箭，可以穿透多个目标并对目标造成 %d%% 无视护甲的穿透伤害。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2bbbc277ce324ddd6592ebf8545af762e833e79802e7847cde67504895c8d6b3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fbff54e2828895b8501f46a02de7c46ff22179f908c952f3f4233806e2c0e071","logical_entry_identity":"837beda51fa3afbb3a6e2f24b0cd72203d2de6e472a8cda84eccabdc6ab71381","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"tutorial3","source_tag":"entity subtype","target":"教程3"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7d7e4a79ff37abe31c0fad4cdd0a5974573437f4ac3f95b0d46175dc7db1c6ab","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fc00b6702b8042c850d236baccc757df99018a255bfe0cb6c36b605b27152b85","logical_entry_identity":"e0b64b609cabb36f66db0959ac1fc4e4fde65274e2627672bdcb12f421def5bb","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"-Directed Speed","source_tag":"_t","target":"-定向加速"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"69b647668e652d241941d43e265b72b09450c3400225d5b19b8dcd83eb43a67b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fc06b0028efb25515c0dfd66f21aa021f8a0729f42dad42ffbeee3fb20cb5357","logical_entry_identity":"eca38c44665de5e21894257c1cb954a3a11eee365cd9ab8275675a36f0e95514","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Piercing Sight","source_tag":"talent name","target":"洞察视界"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"be6bb76f73c2933cb67b9e29e4be2b7bbe1b32d3ca4f2a3ddee58e9ac11542e6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fc06c0a119ab534a4ab4450a1b3bfcd4d378c09e12f7d700696e722840d43d53","logical_entry_identity":"306acbd5950883faab711f0b59393fea921aefd1f26d249eb0bfee5c4e6a34e0","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You wake up in the tranquil meadow, feeling refreshed. The dream seemed to release you from a burden you've been carrying.\nAs you lie there you notice yourself turning something around in your hand. It is the small acorn from the dream.\nYou open your hand and see that it has been stained with someone else's blood. You grip the acorn tighter until you can feel the pain of the biting iron.\n\nYour hate is burning inside you again. If it has to be released then there is only one person who deserves it more than anyone.\nHe had a sanctuary: a cave where he would store his 'profits'. Perhaps you could find him there.\n\nAs you look around the meadow you realize what this place is and perhaps what drew you here.\nKyless had taken you this way once. On the north side of the meadow was a secret path that led to his cave.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"你在宁静的草原醒来，感到浑身轻松。梦境似乎让你摆脱了一直背负着的重担。\n当你躺在那里时，你发现自己正在手中转动着什么。那居然是——梦境中的那颗小铁橡果。\n你摊开手掌，发现橡果上沾上了别人的鲜血。你将橡果握得更紧，直到冰冷的铁硌得掌心生疼。\n\n你心中的仇恨再次燃起。如果必须发泄这股仇恨，那么有一个人比谁都更该承受你的怒火。\n他有一个藏身处——一个可以储藏他的“所得”的洞穴。也许你能在那找到他。\n\n当你环顾四周时，你认出了这是何处，也隐约明白或许是什么将你引来。\n凯勒斯曾带你走过这条路。草原北侧有一条秘密小径通向他的洞穴。\n"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"66da49fcce23e27b95027c5aa51dc41afc9211cbc227c05fd9cfa8413ec4d2aa"}}